# Permit only the source, POM and Docker submission files into the build context.
# Prevent accidental transfer of patient images, local validation logs and secrets.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pom.xml
!src/
!src/**
!docker/
!docker/**
# Even under permitted directories, exclude generated or private artifacts.
**/__pycache__/
**/target/
**/.git/
**/*.dcm
**/*.nii
**/*.nii.gz
**/*.pdf
**/*.log
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.env
**/*secret*
**/*credential*
**/docker-evidence/
